silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_01_reader_onboarding_sections_01_what_the_encyclopedia_is_concrete_anchor_7#orientationpageolog silm:hasLongDescription "The OrientationPageOlog is the page-local olog of the orientation entry. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'O_01', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
